              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Halberd and light armour. May wear heavy armour (+2 pts) and carry a pavise (+1 pt). Stubborn. (Armies of Chivalry p.56)</characteristic>
