              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The cost of the war wagon includes six crewmen: three armed with halberds and three with crossbow or handgun, all with light armour. A team of 2-4 horses. War wagons may be single models (no Leader, Standard Bearer or Musician) or grouped in units of at least three models. One wagon per unit may include a tarasnices (palisade gun) for +20 pts (not built). Stubborn. (Armies of Chivalry p.56)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
