  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="9605-3714-2984-43d2" name="The Hussites (Armies of Chivalry) - List Notes" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF THE HUSSITES 1419-1471 (Armies of Chivalry, p.56). Polish allies (0-25%) are documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[The Hussites]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 75%, at least 50%
  Characters 0-25%, Cavalry 0-25%, Infantry 50-75% (artillery and war wagons from the Infantry allocation). Allies: 0-25% of the army may be Polish allies (documented only).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
